    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*****ALL REPLIES BY EMAIL ONLY DUE TO HIGH VOLUMES AND MUST BE ACCOMPANIED WITH FULLBACKGROUND ON WHEN ACCOMMODATION IS REQUIRED FROM, REFERENCES AND NUMBER OF PEOPLE IN THE GROUP. PETS ARE NOT PERMITTED*******\n\n\nQuillsen are delight to offer this spacious top floor 2 bedroom 2 bathroom apartment with private balcony and access to a larger communal balcony. Lift to all floors. 1 Designated car space in the carpark.\n\nThis bright and airy apartment benefits from open plan living space, large lounge with access to the balcony, dining area which then leads to the fully fitted kitchen which is plumbed for a dishwasher. Accommodation comprises of a L shaped hallway the hotpress which is also plumbed for washer/dryer. There are two good sized double bedrooms both with built in wardrobes and and the main with a full bathroom ensuite. Open plan lounge/dining/kitchen with balcony off. The property is located on the second floor which is the top floor with just one other apartment located on this level. There is a communal terrace.\n\nDouble glazed windows, gas radiator central heating, plumbed for washer/dryer and dishwasher. Walking distance of Clontarf Promenade and the numerous of facilities including cafes and restaurants on the doorstep. Excellent choice of public transport to include buses that are serviced by the Howth Road, 130 on the Clontarf Road and Clontarf Road Dart station just a stroll away.\n\nViewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
